{"id": "22-4155-2-2", "zh": "tud 等根类（Tudādigaṇa）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4156-2-5", "zh": "下面讲以辅音结尾的动词根的变化形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4156-6-13", "zh": "这些形式又按不作元音增强（avuddhika）与作元音增强（savuddhika）分为两种。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4156-14-18", "zh": "其中先讲不作元音增强的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4157-2-17", "zh": "khipa、guha、tuda、disa、pisa、phusa、likha、vadha 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4158-2-10", "zh": "这里动词根末尾的元音只是为了便于发音，在构成词形时不用。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4159-2-36", "zh": "628. 在 tud 等根之后加 ka [ka.445; rū.433; nī.925; caṃ.1.1.92; pā.3.1.77]。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4160-2-6", "zh": "在 tud 等根之后加带 k 附标的词缀 a。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4160-7-9", "zh": "k 附标的作用是表示不作元音增强。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4161-2-19", "zh": "khipa 表示投掷：khipati、pakkhipati、ukkhipati、okkhipati、nikkhipati、vikkhipati、paṭikkhipati、saṃkhipati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4162-2-3", "zh": "被动：khipīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4163-2-24", "zh": "使役：khipeti、khipayati、khipāpeti、khipāpayati，或 khepeti、khepayati，如 udakaṃ khepeti（把水耗尽）、taṇhaṃ khepeti（灭尽贪爱），意思是使它灭尽。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4164-2-7", "zh": "guha 表示隐藏：guhati、nigguhati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4165-2-3", "zh": "被动：guhiyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4166-2-13", "zh": "使役时 gu 的元音变长：gūheti、gūhayati、gūhāpeti、gūhāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4167-2-3", "zh": "被动：gūhāpīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4168-2-5", "zh": "ghaṭa 表示努力：ghaṭati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4169-2-3", "zh": "被动：ghaṭīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4170-2-9", "zh": "使役：ghaṭeti、ghaṭayati、ghaṭāpeti、ghaṭāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4171-2-10", "zh": "tuda 表示刺穿，byadhana 就是刺穿（vijjhana）：tudati、vitudati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4172-2-6", "zh": "词缀 a 变为 e：tudeti、tudenti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4173-2-3", "zh": "被动：tudīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4174-2-10", "zh": "依据“Tavaggavaraṇānaṃ ye cavaggabayañā”（t 组辅音以及 v、r、ṇ 在 y 前分别变为 c 组辅音以及 b、y、ñ）这条规则，d 变为 j。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4174-11-20", "zh": "依据“Vaggalasehi te”这条规则，y 同化为前面的辅音，得 tujjati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4175-2-9", "zh": "使役：tudeti、tudayati、tudāpeti、tudāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4176-2-7", "zh": "disī 表示指示，uddisana 就是按其本来的样子宣说。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4176-8-25", "zh": "uddisati，如 pātimokkhaṃ uddisanti（他们诵出波提木叉）[mahāva.152]；niddisati、niddisanti、apadisati、apadisanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4177-2-5", "zh": "被动：uddisīyati、uddisīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4178-2-11", "zh": "使役：ācariyo sissaṃ pāḷidhammaṃ uddisāpeti（老师让学生诵习圣典之法），uddisāpayati，意思是教他诵读。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4178-12-16", "zh": "不过在一些读本中，两种形式都可以见到。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-4179-2-13", "zh": "nuda 表示驱除：nudati、panudati，或 vinodeti、paṭivinodeti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4180-2-5", "zh": "被动：panudīyati、panujjati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4181-2-9", "zh": "使役：panudeti、panudayati、panudāpeti、panudāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4182-2-5", "zh": "pisa 表示研磨：pisati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4183-2-3", "zh": "被动：pisīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4184-2-9", "zh": "使役：piseti、pisayati、pisāpeti、pisāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4185-2-30", "zh": "phusa 表示接触和到达：phusati，如 phusanti dhīrā nibbānaṃ（智者证得涅槃）[dha.pa.23]、vajjaṃ naṃ phuseyya（他会犯下过失）[pārā.409; cūḷava.344]。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4186-2-3", "zh": "被动：phusīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4187-2-9", "zh": "使役：phuseti、phusayati、phusāpeti、phusāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4188-2-9", "zh": "likha 表示刻写：likhati、sallikhati、vilikhati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4189-2-7", "zh": "使役：likheti、sallikheti、vilikheti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4190-2-7", "zh": "vadha 表示杀害：vadhati、vadheti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4191-2-3", "zh": "被动：vadhīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4192-2-8", "zh": "在 ya 前，dh 变为 jh，y 同化为前面的辅音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4192-9-22", "zh": "依据“Catutthadutiyesvesaṃ tatiyapaṭhamā”（这些组的第四、第二辅音在重叠时，前一个变为第三、第一辅音）这条规则，前一个 jh 变为第三辅音 j：vajjhati、vajjhanti、vajjhare。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4192-23-38", "zh": "Ime sattā haññantu vā vajjhantu vā（愿这些众生被杀，或被害）[ma.ni.1.60]。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4193-2-23", "zh": "使役：vadheti、vadhayati、vadhāpeti、vadhāpayati；sāmiko purisaṃ maggaṃ gameti（主人让人上路）、gamayati、gamāpeti、gamāpayati 等形式，也应在这里讲。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4194-2-4", "zh": "以上是 tud 等根类。", "confidence": 90}
